<title>GREECE: GREEK CPI INFLATION FALLS TO 6.0PCT Y/Y IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>GREEK CPI INFLATION FALLS TO 6.0PCT Y/Y IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's consumer price inflation fell to 6.0 percent year-on-year in March from 6.6 percent in February, a monetary source told Reuters.</p>
<p>Greece's National Statistics Service(NSS) is expected to release the March inflation later today. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
